  "prefLabel": "Lot 8101.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 8101.02 Scope. The rules in this chapter shall apply to all individuals, organizations, associations, or corporations whose involvement in advance deposit wagering conducted in the state of New Hampshire require licensure in accordance with RSA 284:22-c.\n\nSource. #14448, eff 12-3-25, EXPIRES: 12-3-35",
